+| s2 | `GET /customer/cart`: **63**; `GET /products/{productId}`: **2** | 59×500, 41×406, **0×2xx** |
+| s3 | `GET /customer`, `GET /customer/contacts`, `GET /customer/orders`: **66 করে** | 87×500, 13×406, **0×2xx** |
